ionic: port ibv_cmd_get_context() call to rdma-core >= v55 signature

AMD's AINIC ionic provider (rdma-core-54.0.149.g3304be71) was written against
rdma-core v54. Later rdma-core added a `struct ibv_fd_arr *fd_arr` argument to
ibv_cmd_get_context(). Pass NULL, as the upstream ionic provider does.

--- a/providers/ionic/ionic.c
+++ b/providers/ionic/ionic.c
@@ -230,7 +230,7 @@
 		goto err_ctx;
 	}
 
-	rc = ibv_cmd_get_context(&ctx->vctx, &req.ibv_cmd, sizeof(req),
+	rc = ibv_cmd_get_context(&ctx->vctx, &req.ibv_cmd, sizeof(req), NULL,
 				 &resp.ibv_resp, sizeof(resp));
 	if (rc)
 		goto err_cmd;
